# Pinned versions of the artefacts this SDK consumes.
#
# Everything here comes from another repository at a released tag. Nothing is
# built from a sibling checkout, and nothing is derived from where this package
# happens to sit on disk — that assumption is what the monorepo satisfied
# silently and what the split removed.

# github.com/timeflareio/crypto — provides two things:
#   the WASM bundle this package ships (make wasm-sync), and
#   the primitive vector corpus its conformance tests assert (make vectors-sync).
CRYPTO_VERSION=v0.0.1

# github.com/timeflareio/chain — provides two things:
#   the protobuf definitions src/generated/ is generated from (make proto-sync),
#   and the chain-semantics vector corpus (make vectors-sync).
#
# The floor is v0.0.2: the corpus is now read from that release's tarball and
# manifest, and earlier chain tags carry no release at all. v0.0.1 and v0.0.2
# hold byte-identical protos and vectors, so the bump moves where they are
# fetched from, not what they contain.
CHAIN_VERSION=v0.0.2
